@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Added a "Storage conditions" field to the product page, so staff can record how a product must be stored (e.g. "Keep refrigerated at 2–8 °C"). The text is shown to customers in the product description on the storefront. It can be translated on the product translation page; products without a translation show the original text.
